## Resolution

Implemented bounded language corpus/group/token validation before activations, original-teacher train/validation FFN pairs with actual document/token/row provenance and independent teacher recomputation, and no test activations. Train-only shared-channel initialization covers pruning, linear/cubic splines and SVD after the explicitly recorded reduction, preserving all earlier bounds. Local SGD selects only by validation and saves initial/current/best weights, full calibration/config/order/step, stateless optimizer and explicit no-RNG state. Saved checkpoints continue exactly, rather than replaying from zero, and selected artifacts export into the real decoder with licence/provenance records.

At `04901a53`, **62 host tests**, both portable rlibs and all previous plus calibration/train/resume/export CLI cycles passed. Independent real-model PyTorch channel selection and four SGD steps match; all four compressed initializers run. Corrupt source/data/checkpoint/shape/order/budget/overwrite cases are refused. [Dated evidence](../nrl/reports/local-training-2026-10-26.json), [raw log](../nrl/reports/local-check-2026-10-26.txt), [saved checkpoint example](../nrl/reports/local-example-2026-10-26/report.json), [contract](../nrl/specs/calibration-local-v0.md).

T07 is complete for the declared scalar f64 replacement profile. Before any T08 study test evaluation, the six candidate plans, validation quality/package budgets and T10 adaptation protocol/rounds were fixed in `nrl/tests/fixtures/study-v0/profile.json`, whose hash is recorded in the evidence. T08–T10 continue as explicitly requested, independently of landing. Local metrics alone are not model-quality, speed or compression evidence; native execution remains separate.
